 "description": "On February 22, 2025, the Twin Cities leather community gathered for an afternoon of naughty education and community vibes at Class Is In Session during TANK Weekend. This event featured four sizzling workshops, covering everything from brutal intimacy and electrical play to suspension bottoming and play partner vetting. Whether attendees were eager to learn, explore, or just watch, things definitely heated up!\n\nSpectrum also hosted a BIPOC social in the Fireside Bar, ensuring a welcoming space for all.\n\nThis free event helped raise funds for the design, creation, and ceremonial unveiling of the new Leather Pride Flag. Attendees also had the chance to support the Flag Fund by purchasing the 2025 \"Our Flag Is Bigger\" dog tags and MNLP patches.\n\nCheck out the highlights below and relive the experience!",
